WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:05.960
I think the biggest thing is just recognizing that we're going

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:07.560
to have AI forever.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Like there's no getting away from any of that.

00:00:11.093 --> 00:00:14.053
If you don't know how to use it, you're going to fall behind.

00:00:13.993 --> 00:00:18.153
That being said, if that's all you use, you're useless because

00:00:17.853 --> 00:00:19.433
anyone can use AI.

00:00:19.706 --> 00:00:26.206
so if I had an e-bike I know myself well enough that I would

00:00:25.906 --> 00:00:29.646
probably start relying on the e-bike intensively rather than

00:00:29.346 --> 00:00:33.386
getting a workout that I need every day So it's so much easier

00:00:33.086 --> 00:00:35.546
to be complacent when the tool is there.

00:00:36.106 --> 00:00:39.426
Whereas like some people will use e-bikes for mountain biking

00:00:39.126 --> 00:00:42.300
and they'll still get really good workouts out of it.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:45.790
It's not like we can choose to not buy the e-bike.

00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:50.407
Oh, sorry — I bought it yeah I bought it for almost like I literally

00:00:50.107 --> 00:00:51.633
bought it for everybody

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:55.500
I think you know even though it's fictional I think prime examples

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:59.760
like Tony Stark who you know he knows all the math he knows

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:03.086
everything that he needs to do where Jarvis is a support to

00:01:02.786 --> 00:01:05.633
Tony Stark and not doing Tony Stark's work

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:07.760
We about to get YouTube famous.

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:09.940
So, pick up a thousand likes on this.

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:11.833
We're changing our career.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:15.420
Or maybe I misheard Audrey but I think I heard her say reel

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:18.660
— so like you know we can make like a reel of us like being

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:20.733
this is good this is bad

00:01:21.073 --> 00:01:22.633
We'll probably call it good there.

00:01:23.113 --> 00:01:24.533
Thanks, Audrey, Carl, everybody.
